<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>About - URL Shortener</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <%- include("partials/header") %>

    <main class="page-container">
      <section class="about-section">
        <h1>About URL Shortener</h1>

        <p>
          Welcome to our URL Shortener. This website helps you convert long and
          complicated URLs into short and easy-to-share links.
        </p>

        <p>
          Instead of sharing a long URL, you can create a short link that is
          easier to remember and share with others.
        </p>

        <h2>Why Use URL Shortener?</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>Convert long URLs into short links</li>
          <li>Easy to share with others</li>
          <li>Simple and clean interface</li>
          <li>Fast URL redirection</li>
          <li>Manage your shortened URLs easily</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How It Works</h2>

        <p>
          Enter your original URL, choose a custom short code if available, and
          create your shortened URL. When someone visits the short URL, they
          will automatically be redirected to the original website.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include("partials/footer") %>
  </body>
</html>
